+==========================================================================+
|                         SAFETY BACKPLANE BOARD                           |
|      Unified Discrete Logic Safety Computer (No MCU, No Load)            |
+==========================================================================+

   POWER INPUT & BASELINES
   -----------------------
   [BAT+]----[FUSE]----+-----------------------------------------------+
                       |                                               |
                      [RSENSE]                                         |
                       |                                               |
                      NODE_I                                           |
                                                                       |
   [BAT-]---------------------------------------------------------------+---- GND


==============================================================================
  COLD-START DELAY (PREVENTS IN-RUSH ACTIVATION)
==============================================================================

   [BAT+]----[RCH] 100kΩ----+---- NODE_DELAY ----[Q1] NPN ---> DELAY_OK
                            |
                           [CDELAY] 10µF
                            |
                           GND

   DELAY_OK gates all downstream logic:
   DELAY_OK ----[RDK]----> ENABLE_WINDOW


==============================================================================
  MULTI-SENSOR FIRE-PREVENTION MATRIX
==============================================================================

   SENSORS:
     NODE_I    (current sense from RSENSE)
     NODE_TH   (hotspot thermistor)
     NODE_CASE (enclosure thermistor)
     NODE_AIR  (airflow vane / thermal airflow sensor)

   COMPARATORS:
     U_I    : NODE_I    vs I_REF_MAX   → I_FAULT
     U_TH   : NODE_TH   vs T_REF_HOT   → TH_FAULT
     U_CASE : NODE_CASE vs T_REF_CASE  → CASE_FAULT
     U_AIR  : NODE_AIR  vs AIR_MIN     → AIR_FAULT

   DISCRETE OR NETWORK:
     I_FAULT ----\
                  +----> MATRIX_FAULT
     TH_FAULT ---/
     CASE_FAULT -\
                  +----> MATRIX_FAULT
     AIR_FAULT --/

   MATRIX_FAULT ----[Q2] NPN ---> FAULT_LINE


==============================================================================
  THERMAL HYSTERESIS BLOCK (AUTO-COOLDOWN LOGIC)
==============================================================================

   NODE_TH --> U_HI (trip comparator)
                IN+ = NODE_TH
                IN- = T_HIGH_REF
                → HOT_FAULT

   NODE_TH --> U_LO (reset comparator)
                IN+ = NODE_TH
                IN- = T_LOW_REF
                → COOL_OK

   HOT_FAULT ----[Q3] NPN----> HYST_SET
   COOL_OK  ----[Q4] NPN----> HYST_RESET

   SR LATCH (Discrete):
     HYST_SET ----\
                   +----> HYST_LATCH_OUT
     HYST_RESET ---/

   HYST_LATCH_OUT → HYST_FAULT


==============================================================================
  MASTER SAFETY LATCH (GLOBAL FAULT MEMORY)
==============================================================================

   FAULT_LINE ----\
                   +----> MASTER_SET
   HYST_FAULT ----/

   MASTER_SET ----[Q5] NPN----> MASTER_LATCH_SET

   RESET_SW ----[Q6] NPN----> MASTER_LATCH_RESET

   CROSS-COUPLED LATCH:
     MASTER_LATCH_SET ----> QLATCH_M
     MASTER_LATCH_RESET --> QLATCH_MB

   QLATCH_M → MASTER_FAULT_OUT (HIGH = latched fault)


==============================================================================
  GLOBAL SHUTDOWN OUTPUT (FINAL BOARD OUTPUT)
==============================================================================

   GLOBAL_SHUTDOWN:
     MASTER_FAULT_OUT ----> GLOBAL_SHUTDOWN (HIGH = inhibit system)

   LED INDICATORS:
     MATRIX_FAULT      ----[RLED1]----> LED_MATRIX
     HYST_FAULT        ----[RLED2]----> LED_HYST
     MASTER_FAULT_OUT  ----[RLED3]----> LED_MASTER

+==========================================================================+
| BOARD SUMMARY                                                            |
| - Cold-start delay gates activation.                                     |
| - Multi-sensor matrix detects current, heat, enclosure temp, airflow.    |
| - Hysteresis enforces cooldown before re-enable.                         |
| - Master latch prevents auto-restart after any fault.                    |
| - Entire board is discrete logic, no MCU, no load.                       |
+==========================================================================+
